{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">網絡今日（8日）瘋傳一段車Cam影片，事發於今晨灣仔堅尼地道，車Cam車主如常沿車道行駛期間，路旁一名女途人不知何故突然仆倒，整個人險些摔出馬路撞向車身，情況萬分危急。萬幸司機眼明手快，於千鈞一髮之際即時扭軚閃避，成功避開女途人，避免了一場嚴重意外。樓主將這段驚險經歷分享至網絡，慶幸表示：「好彩遇著我 」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-17h11m09s156.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QEc42Ovce61791451225.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-17h11m09s156.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-17h11m23s912.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026H2t24hPwcC1791451231.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-17h11m23s912.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\">片段引發大批網民圍觀，眾人看完過程均捏一把汗，直指畫面猶如「死神來了」，並一致洗版力讚司機的超卓反應與駕車技術，網民對司機迅速扭軚且未有擦撞鄰線表示佩服，留言大讚：「勁，快扭過佢又冇撞到隔離」、「好睇反應夠快」。更有網民認為司機的化險為夷表現堪稱典範，留言指：「師兄呢段片真係可以做教材」。</p><h2 style=\"text-align: left\"></h2></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T09:59:36.854067+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}